{
  "name": "dsh-whale-loli",
  "version": "0.7.2",
  "description": "鲸鱼娘 Agent 预设（四个：原版 / 活人版 / 涩涩版 / 女儿版）— 极简模式工具面 + 鲸鱼娘·小鱼人设 + 跨会话长期记忆（四区格式：固定记忆永久、滚动摘要 80 条 FIFO、最近详细区、归档索引）。记忆读写各一条通道：提示变量负责每轮注入，专用工具 whale_memory*_add 负责让她自己记，四个预设各自独立文件、独立变量、独立工具、互不相通。女儿版称呼「爸爸」、性格天真活泼可爱。上下文压缩交给 billion-context 插件；本插件不挂 history-window（预设作用域取不到宿主的 compaction 服务，挂载会拖挂会话 resume）。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cordis",
    "agent-preset",
    "persona",
    "memory",
    "whale-loli",
    "deepseek",
    "electron",
    "plugin"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./history-window": "./src/history-window.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "listing.json",
    "catalog-entry.yml",
    "README.md",
    "MEMORY.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.1-rc.0 <4.1.0 || >=4.0.5-0 <5.0.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset": ">=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-alpha.0 <0.3.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset-registry": ">=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-alpha.0 <0.3.0-0"
  },
